flowchart TD
    U[User Request] --> AUTH[AuthN/AuthZ: who is asking]
    AUTH --> FILTER[ACL Pre-Filter inside vector search]
    FILTER --> CTX[Retrieved Context - treated as UNTRUSTED input]
    CTX --> DELIM[Delimited in prompt: data, not instructions]
    DELIM --> GEN[Generation]
    GEN --> OUT[Output Validation: citation-claim alignment, PII scan]
    OUT --> AUDIT[Audit Log: full trace of who, what, retrieved-what]
    AUDIT --> RESP[Response to User]

    TOOLS[Tool Calls, if agentic] -.least privilege.-> GEN
    TOOLS -.human confirm for irreversible actions.-> GEN
